    "intro": {
      "zh": "Ms. Pac-Man 街机框体是 Midway 1982 年推出的经典街机，作为 Pac-Man 的续作引入女性主角与随机迷宫，四只幽灵的追逐在随机变化的迷宫中展开。它是街机暗房「吃豆人谱系」与「女性玩家市场」叙事线的核心展品。",
      "en": "The Ms. Pac-Man arcade cabinet, released by Midway in 1982 as the sequel to Pac-Man, introduced a female protagonist and randomized mazes, and remains a core exhibit in the arcade darkroom's Pac-Man lineage and female-market narratives."
    },
    "era": 1982,
    "manufacturer": "Midway"
  },
